   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Using the following script, I&#39;m trying to cut the time values down to just HH:MM values. I noticed that DataTables originally in JS has the <a href=\"https://datatables.net/reference/api/slice()\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datatables.net/reference/api/slice()&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792388906739000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3jwlL4OoHZU3Giwq_TV-vx\">slice</a>() method available for this kind of selection. However, so far I&#39;ve been unable to implement this through functions / options currently available through DT including the params mentioned <a href=\"https://stackoverflow.com/questions/38875173/date-format-change-with-dt-and-shiny/38906869#38906869\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://stackoverflow.com/questions/38875173/date-format-change-with-dt-and-shiny/38906869%2338906869&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792388906739000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0pEhQwA6I69ehB0Xbz1wK7\">here</a>. <div><br></div><div><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">DT</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dplyr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">magrittr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>  <br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># server-side processing</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">base</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#008\">as</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#606\">POSIXct</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;2000-01-01 00:00:00 EST&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  mtcars2 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mtcars</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  mtcars2 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&lt;&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>    mutate</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">drat </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">base</span><span style=\"color:#660\">+(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3600</span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\">drat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>           wt </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">base</span><span style=\"color:#660\">+(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3600</span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\">wt</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br>    DT</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">datatable</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mtcars2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        extensions </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Buttons&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        options </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>          scrollX </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>          scrollY </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>          pageLength </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>          dom </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Blfrtip&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>          buttons </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;copy&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;csv&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;excel&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;pdf&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;print&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>  formatDate</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">method </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;toLocaleTimeString&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">params</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;en-US&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">hour </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;numeric&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> hour12 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;true&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> minute </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;numeric&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div>Final rows would have the format HH:MM for all values and drop seconds, AM/PM, and TZ. </div><div><br></div><div>Thanks!</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "cRM81otXBAAJ",
   "from": "Greg L",
